2026-09-27T07:22:14.4052184Z Description:
2026-09-27T07:22:14.4052439Z This PPA contains more recent Python versions packaged for Ubuntu.
2026-09-27T07:22:14.4052784Z 
2026-09-27T07:22:14.4053348Z Disclaimer: there's no guarantee of timely updates in case of security problems or other issues. If you want to use them in a security-or-otherwise-critical environment (say, on a production server), you do so at your own risk.
